     "<div dir=\"ltr\">您好，目前想要刪除相同ID在時間序列下出現&quot;連續相同&quot;的事件，如下圖左變成下圖右，應該如何處理? 非常謝謝!!<div><br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3LYaQn0d9JU/WM6TNA-hFyI/AAAAAAAABVU/Vhwl4OJqMOEccx_qROuKflBcR0KJteOXwCLcB/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%25871.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3LYaQn0d9JU/WM6TNA-hFyI/AAAAAAAABVU/Vhwl4OJqMOEccx_qROuKflBcR0KJteOXwCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E7%252589%2525871.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237739187000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Uq_xR08xvuUdPK9x7D2vY\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3LYaQn0d9JU/WM6TNA-hFyI/AAAAAAAABVU/Vhwl4OJqMOEccx_qROuKflBcR0KJteOXwCLcB/s400/%25E5%259C%2596%25E7%2589%25871.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"217\"></a></p><div><br></div></div></div>"
